      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZA PUNK ROCKER NZ (2) had been about the mark in recent runs before the latest appearance when he got the job done again, scoring by 9 metres over 2138m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. That latest effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. FERNCO NEL NZ (5) finished fourth last start over 2138m at this track, beaten 19 metres, after a modest sixth at this track the run prior. Meets a similar quality field and is good enough to put himself in the winners' stall. BARTELLO (1) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at Menangle over 2300m. Genuine threat. BLUTO NZ (7) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance over 2138m at this track.",
